# This repository is LF-native in the working tree.
#
# core.autocrlf=true was rewriting checked-out files to CRLF. The release build copies files
# straight from the working tree into dist/client, so a line-ending conversion changes the bytes
# the Worker serves and every asset hash with them. Pin the checkout so no contributor's global
# git config can reintroduce that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by text conversion.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.sqlite binary
*.tgz  binary
